# ARCS views

- Reuse the layout and components: `<x-seat-map>`, `<x-country-select>`, `<x-todays-flights>`, and in Sprint 2 `<x-card-form>` (R9) and `<x-receipt>` (R10). Never copy their markup into a page.
- `<x-seat-map>` and `resources/js/seat-map.js` are shared by reservation, check-in and gate. If you change them, say so in the report and keep R1, C3, C6 tests green.
- Confirmations are on-page panels, never JavaScript `confirm()`.
- Staff see names, not codes (countries, cabin classes, statuses).
- Amounts through the Money formatter; times in Beirut time.
- Card fields: never `old()` a card number or CVC; never put them in the session.
- Tailwind classes only (no inline styles); run `npm run build` after adding new classes.
